{"hw":"Σωκράτης","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Σωκράτης</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Σωκράτ-ης</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Scorates</cite>: gen. <span class=\"gk\">Σωκράτους</span>; acc. sg. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">Σωκράτη</span> (as also in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">182</span> </span>, etc.), in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mem.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.2.33</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">Σωκράτην</span>; voc. <span class=\"gk\">Σώκρατες</span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Dim.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Σωκρατίδιον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">dear little Socrates!</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">222</span> </span>, al.</div></div>"}